<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>彭奕卓｜个人主页</title>
  <meta name="description" content="彭奕卓的个人主页。复旦大学国际事务硕士研究生，关注AI方向运营、战略运营与数字化项目支持实习机会。" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --black: #0a0a0a;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --cream: #f7f2e8;
      --paper: #fbf7ef;
      --muted: #666666;
      --yellow: #ffd166;
      --pink: #ff6b7a;
      --blue: #2f81f7;
      --green: #39745f;
      --purple: #6366f1;
      --orange: #ff9f1c;
      --radius-lg: 30px;
      --radius-md: 20px;
      --shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,1);
      --shadow-small: 5px 5px 0 rgba(0,0,0,1);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--black);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 8% 8%, rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.28), transparent 24%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 12%, rgba(47, 129, 247, 0.14), transparent 26%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(255, 107, 122, 0.12), transparent 24%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, var(--cream) 100%);
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
        "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 82px 0;
    }

    .nav-wrap {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      padding: 24px 0 14px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .nav {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--black);
      padding: 14px 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 22px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      opacity: 0.62;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-small);
      padding: 14px 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translate(2px, 2px);
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--black);
    }

    .btn.secondary {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 70px 0 76px;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      gap: 64px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      width: fit-content;
      background: var(--yellow);
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 84px);
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      font-weight: 950;
    }

    .highlight {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--pink);
      color: var(--white);
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 0 12px 5px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-small);
      transform: rotate(-1deg);
    }

    .hero-text {
      margin: 28px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 680px;
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      font-weight: 520;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }

    .quick-info {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .quick-item {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 15px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .quick-item span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .avatar-card {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--yellow);
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 38px;
      box-shadow: -10px 10px 0 var(--black);
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 560px;
    }

    .avatar-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 560px;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center top;
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }

    .floating-note {
      position: absolute;
      left: 22px;
      bottom: 24px;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 12px 15px;
      font-weight: 950;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-small);
      transform: rotate(2deg);
    }

    .marquee-section {
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 24px 0 40px;
    }

    .marquee {
      background: var(--blue);
      border-top: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-bottom: 4px solid var(--black);
      transform: rotate(-2deg) scale(1.04);
      padding: 22px 0;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .marquee-track {
      display: inline-flex;
      animation: scroll 20s linear infinite;
    }

    .marquee span {
      color: var(--white);
      margin: 0 34px;
      font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 46px);
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    @keyframes scroll {
      0% { transform: translateX(0); }
      100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
    }

    .section-head {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .section-head .label {
      display: inline-flex;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 7px 13px;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 58px);
      line-height: 1.14;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      font-weight: 950;
    }

    .section-head p {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 780px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      font-weight: 520;
    }

    .grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 28px;
      transition: transform .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translate(-3px, -3px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;
      gap: 56px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .profile-panel {
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 34px;
      box-shadow: -10px 10px 0 var(--yellow);
      padding: 34px;
    }

    .profile-panel h3 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-size: 38px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }

    .profile-panel p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .about h2 {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px);
      line-height: 1.16;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }

    .about-intro {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin: 0 0 26px;
    }

    .quality-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .quality {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .quality h4 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .quality p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .experience-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 170px 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .date-pill {
      align-self: start;
      background: var(--yellow);
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      font-weight: 950;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-small);
    }

    .experience-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 1.38;
    }

    .experience-card ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.9;
      font-weight: 520;
    }

    .metric-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .metric {
      background: var(--cream);
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .metric strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 30px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .metric span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 750;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .project-cover {
      min-height: 250px;
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 26px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .project-cover.yellow {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd166, #ffe7a3);
    }

    .project-cover.blue {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2f81f7, #77b2ff);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .project-index {
      width: fit-content;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-weight: 950;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .project-title-en {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 62px);
      line-height: .95;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      font-weight: 950;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 25px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.85;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .work-list {
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .skill-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .skill-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .portfolio-feature {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 34px;
      padding: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .95fr 1.05fr;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .portfolio-pdf {
      min-height: 420px;
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 28px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,.8), transparent 16%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), #d6c1a1);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 30px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .portfolio-pdf .small {
      width: fit-content;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 7px 13px;
      font-weight: 950;
    }

    .portfolio-pdf .big {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 78px);
      line-height: .95;
      letter-spacing: -0.07em;
      font-weight: 950;
    }

    .portfolio-text h3 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
      line-height: 1.14;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }

    .portfolio-text p {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .portfolio-gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .work-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 14px;
      transition: transform .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease;
    }

    .work-card:hover {
      transform: translate(-3px,-3px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .work-img {
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
      border: 3px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--cream);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .work-img.wide {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    }

    .work-img img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: top center;
    }

    .work-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .work-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .contact {
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 76px 0 36px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .contact-box {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
      border: 4px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25);
      padding: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .contact-box h2 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }

    .contact-box p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .contact-card {
      border: 3px solid var(--white);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .contact-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .contact-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 950;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .copyright {
      margin-top: 34px;
      padding-top: 22px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.68);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .hero-grid,
      .about-grid,
      .grid-2,
      .grid-3,
      .portfolio-feature,
      .contact-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .portfolio-gallery {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
      }

      .metric-grid,
      .quick-info {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .avatar-card {
        max-width: 540px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .experience-card {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .date-pill {
        width: fit-content;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .container {
        width: min(100% - 24px, 1180px);
      }

      .section {
        padding: 58px 0;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 42px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 40px;
        line-height: 1.22;
      }

      .hero-text {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .quick-info,
      .quality-grid,
      .metric-grid,
      .portfolio-gallery {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .avatar-card,
      .avatar-card img {
        min-height: 430px;
      }

      .copyright {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .contact-card p {
        font-size: 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="nav-wrap">
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#" class="brand">彭奕卓</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#about">关于我</a>
        <a href="#experience">实习经历</a>
        <a href="#projects">项目经历</a>
        <a href="#skills">技能工具</a>
        <a href="#portfolio">作品集</a>
      </div>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:pyz1789@outlook.com">联系我</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">2027届硕士研究生 · 一周内可到岗</div>
          <h1>
            我是
            <span class="highlight">彭奕卓</span><br />
            关注 AI 与运营的探索者
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-text">
            复旦大学国际事务硕士研究生，正在寻找 AI 方向运营、战略运营与数字化项目支持相关实习机会。可连续实习 3–6 个月，关注 AI 工具落地、业务提效、项目推进与内容传播。
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn" href="mailto:pyz1789@outlook.com">发送邮件</a>
            <a class="btn secondary" href="#portfolio">查看作品集</a>
          </div>

          <div class="quick-info">
            <div class="quick-item">复旦大学<span>国际事务｜硕士</span></div>
            <div class="quick-item">AI 项目支持<span>培训组织｜内容传播</span></div>
            <div class="quick-item">3–6 个月<span>一周内可到岗</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="avatar-card">
          <img src="avatar.png" alt="彭奕卓 AI 卡通头像" />
          <div class="floating-note">Fudan · AI Operations</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="marquee-section" aria-label="关键词">
      <div class="marquee">
        <div class="marquee-track">
          <span>AI 方向运营</span>
          <span>战略运营</span>
          <span>数字化项目支持</span>
          <span>内容传播</span>
          <span>项目推进</span>
          <span>AI 方向运营</span>
          <span>战略运营</span>
          <span>数字化项目支持</span>
          <span>内容传播</span>
          <span>项目推进</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="section about">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div class="profile-panel">
          <h3>About Me</h3>
          <p>
            我不是技术型候选人，但希望成为懂业务、能表达、能推进的 AI 与数字化项目支持者。相比单纯堆叠概念，我更关注工具如何真正进入业务流程、提升协作效率，并通过清楚的材料、内容和执行让项目向前推进。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">关于我 · How I Work</div>
          <h2>在研究、内容与执行之间，形成可靠的工作方式</h2>
          <p class="about-intro">
            我是复旦大学国际事务专业硕士研究生，本科毕业于华南理工大学行政管理专业。具备金融机构 AI 能力建设与数字化项目支持经验，熟悉项目材料整理、跨部门沟通协调、活动执行、内容传播与基础数据分析。
          </p>

          <div class="quality-grid">
            <div class="quality">
              <h4>项目推进</h4>
              <p>重视任务边界、时间节点和交付物，习惯将复杂事务拆解为可执行步骤。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="quality">
              <h4>内容表达</h4>
